# Sparse particles on the bass track (P1 40, P2 60): short and long notes, soft and hard (velocity sets the
# crackle), re-struck notes stealing their voice, a low C1 and a glide (bend) while particles ring.
tempo 110
steps 32
tail 3.0
track bass
preset 40 60 0 80 200 90 0 0 128 0 128 210 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C2 4 127
note 4 G1 2 40
note 6 C2 2 90
note 8 C1 8 127
bend 10 -200
bend 14 0
note 16 Eb2 4 127
note 18 Eb2 4 127
note 20 Bb1 12 70
param p1 90 24
expect sound 0 30
expect idle 80
expect peak_below -4
